  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving the quality of life in the rural communities of the Sierra Sur and coast of Oaxaca</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SICOBI, which is made up of 10 member communities, will work in the Copalita-Zimatan-Huatulco watershed in southern Oaxaca to further economic development and biodiversity through better community management of forestry, agroforestry and ecotourism; to introduce its new products and services in regional markets; and to improve its representation of its 10 members.</narrative>
  </description>
